ebp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=560f740d5570727d8c767840732ba53c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42113a32/uploads/origins/ca371990-ddca-4b95-83c5-851bea7ee288?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5cc25311fa35325e6e92e19273aeba0f 3x"}, "body": "\u3053\u3093\u3070\u3093\u306f\uff01\nHello! I am a fan from China. I love your art style so much that I would like to commission you to create an illustration for my original character.\nHer name is Jiang (Rivera). She is a 31 year old female, 166cm tall, with pale skin, dark brown hair and green eyes with heavy dark circles. She is cold-blooded and quiet, good at hiding her true thoughts. She is a workaholic who often works overtime and does whatever it takes to accomplish her goals. During the day, she handles paperwork in the office, while at night she secretly carries out assassinations to destroy her enemies. She smokes, and uses either a pistol or a short knife as a weapon.\nI really like the contrast between [Silent Worker] and [Dangerous Assassin], and I hope you'll draw the unknown dark side of her that operates at night and is covered in blood. You can play around with other details and make changes to clothing and weapons freely.\nPlease forgive me if there\u2019re any offensive word. Wish you have a good day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4H4deigV5rw0Ou5mT8AsU_UTJFYJWWz", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@bisuka/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1481513, "client_id": 2212225, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6087bfb8f1820e6ec44878af2f3ec733", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-5